#AREA Dark Empire~

#AUTHORS Presto~

#HELPS
-1 DARKEMPIRE~
The Dark Empire area contains two parts:
  The Caverns of the Dark Empire:
These are the caverns belonging the races of the dark empire: Drow,
Orcs, and Ogres.  The empire may only be entered by those level 13 and 
higher of the three races.
  The Valley of the Undead:
This part of the area is a part where anyone can venture.  It's designed
for players levels 5-10, though it works as an alignment adjusting area
for anyone wishing to become good.

  (-) Back




{-}PRESTO
~
0 $~

#RANGES 0 99 0 99

#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_NOTELEPORT

